    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219502e1694854632163c1d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠与樱花千代王、\n樱花进王一同到会场观看比赛。\n她们三位幼时都曾是“胜利俱乐部”的成员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6f1015891352e0b8633dbe703dc241a782d1c1be82b79d04a827122f770413",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:876f166c2d8b61b63ca5359b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f79a00cc5de1e5822d294bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据她们说，\n胜利俱乐部历代毕业生中不乏各方面的先驱者。\n其中也有曾克服伤势重新振作的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a61718251b2f97e13234b6f8dc1659df3cdd64df053a442b19b5c7efcd94a16f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce2082e200211a6cd30e40b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299560c2ea7d979757ea043a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠说起当时俱乐部人们为她\n设计了负担较轻的训练，令她受益良多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c137ece0f2fc6e9426237a7b694e13c54d26e45f4ca5a617865218da65f04a5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4de25cab98876c1d230835a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bd1e901e04871d8187bcbe7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，训练员向胜利俱乐部借调资料，\n想用来参考如何预防受伤。\n当中记载着历代赛马娘们对抗病痛的壮烈纪录。",
      "source_fingerprint": "552228ec79eeb2353c77552562ab2cc086ed01f1a2aaa0660331b84d48643628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a883c1ec7f8dcb38bbe8b0c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c66c410af113f7f68088f37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当天晚上训练员做了恶梦。\n梦中樱花桂冠在国外远征时受了重伤──\n……一场不希望实现的可怕的梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e17a8a86c3ea44846da4cd40fc1e463c33be675d227901b9ac006f77a4ecd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16a853bc841ea86cafa21ef9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前辈们的纪录",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e4540ea3a77b909cb0d8ae9338017fd1d8225320931010d0286c116cefe0c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68beb77245b8831edb858f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b75ad752c56e1be3858b3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠找训练员商量身体状况。\n据说她的脚只要承受到过强的负担就会产生痛楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c431610f1a666334675c5f3c4d20083270bbeb73acfe93b288d2e5c6f8fbd6bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f4b55af2a00302db3ff6b08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f895608725a5347781e487",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在此时，樱花千代王也前来找训练员谈话。\n她相当担心樱花桂冠会因执着于挑战\n仅有一次机会的梦想而不惜伤害双脚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "782e5a8658186c6ae12adde4ffede30359a20306508c532979139954daadf8b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a327b314293c1f778467d30a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a678bc37dc32a9086e97ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但训练员仍表示自己无法夺走樱花桂冠的梦想。\n训练员早已决定，只要她想奔跑，\n自己就会陪她一起实现梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43b5b3e65d921f9a88d994cd5e23703f044e6a56afa4fc83fff32e427643265",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b6ccf4ce277f6dbee5150c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3965e573161a2412ea2a03b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠也很清楚自己的双脚还很脆弱，\n严禁逞强。\n因此她提出想趁现在整理出理想跑法的概念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed2472e142d7dea70b905cd1fc9456fc7ae767181a0a8f7ed781ef7224df422",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce88229a8fc3db355963cbe2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a27634b4ac93387b552c0490",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "利用休养期间努力学习研究，\n观察竞争对手们的比赛。\n她相信这么做一定有助于实现梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03abd12a721b04694cface348f2d4869ea880cacef9970510216214e0b18489a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e4ea45dd0646904927784d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "渴望光芒",
      "source_fingerprint": "244d60115df7d2466a0b027ab8f2c137969e79684adf401aef6ebc1a07994d95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94fe314d2efbdb5502e83993",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠决定压抑住对“日本德比”的渴望。\n甚至从最憧憬的成田白仁身上转开视线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83cf900e15531a07453332290da2033f702ecb4964c6548ff54bdd8ff3811367",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76179171240a8cb0ca42c4d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员也相当烦恼，向琵琶晨光寻求建言。\n他委婉迂回地说出樱花桂冠\n对成田白仁和日本德比抱持的意念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a1b76b77fa62ab118e939d2fd2f3d7d5c0f7620bb853659f4185e181275f6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e543795c4ba058e4550fdb96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光的回答是不要逃避。\n她表示若未曾挑战就放弃，\n那遗憾恐怕会遗留终身。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d680fd0d18a8121f248c3956db19616782fa155ddc4f897d905b3401a0abbf2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4b9d0b4a0b5e072d016b76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还说道，\n若想超越成田白仁就得先认清她的本质。\n此番话令训练员下定决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b590bbef200f91b725ac73bc40e7a0e9327c3b6dd2b516b429c01651c906ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b00c45b2f5ab8400a9097435",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着他对樱花桂冠列出往后方针。\n是时候该为两人的未来做出抉择了……\n究竟是否该参赛“日本德比”？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb4ca28c790d59d12a2336f6a54aee718807fd1db59472cb4f8de4bd53c88d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076403.json",
      "json_path": [
