    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d64eaba6f5b18e02c0cf6f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠提出想观摩成田白仁练跑。\n似乎有些事情令她很在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1611a2ef0170b5fe1d9873eb3dc8eb26915f0cb60e8aee1849362e61be113c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
