    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4a3552c957f51a837e7efc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此刻她想陪在成田白仁身旁。\n樱花桂冠留下来守护着那死命奔跑的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed47fd2ec0aab1939c0c9e85a88591610ff46699c2a059536f72ad5f2b3f75d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076404.json",
      "json_path": [
