    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175f5cc5d219841d118b39fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠从今天起开始参加夏季集训。\n她将利用这段时间进行强化训练，\n好好提升实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf5109b02d0264f7dd40297d89c6b66790707b7d79b06d52a34ee9b221863246",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
