    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50d7bd82128525dd3670da92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠今年也开始进行夏季集训。\n她充满干劲，决不让“想超越憧憬”的\n意念永远只能是空谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92af6817715226445c402967ce33761ffd75a06bd39ab5f164797ab33bc027a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
