    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef14c82cbb6bed7d1e492083",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "害怕受伤的恐惧与日俱增，\n就连出道战当天，\n他仍不禁担心樱花桂冠会过于逞强而伤害身体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce72a769cd17ef65d981572156d7d2c7bd83eb2930f38e902c15d03955ef2ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
