      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但樱花桂冠却反过来提醒他别因恐惧而失去冷静。\n因为她并不希望训练员保护自己──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ea84436232c00d71b6b1d6f7f986f62de563ed4a3dc80ade4c4164bf9274ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
