      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能参赛“皋月赏”纯粹因为身体状况刚好不错，\n但脚的悬念仍尚未完全解决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "159308f758a2f103979a2572efd1d4a6f087f8bc4cfec3348ca553aa8cdeb1e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
